/E (The Tragedy of March 2nd: The most severe incident occurred at the beginning of the month. An Iranian ballistic missile carrying a heavy warhead struck a residential neighborhood in the city. Reports confirmed a direct hit on an apartment building: between 4 and 5 people were killed, and over 100 sustained injuries of varying degrees of severity. The blast wave damaged hundreds of apartments, necessitating the mass evacuation of 500 residents.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
112 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 222 0 R
/E (One of our congregants, Yulia Chernyakhovskaya, and her two young children were among the residents of those buildings. God preserved her family in a supernatural way; the shockwave and shrapnel missed her son. However, the child has suffered psychological trauma as a result of the event.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
